--   "line N" below is a line of that file.
--
-- Every fact here is one a witness of ordinary competence could be asked about,
-- or a status a register records. Nothing here is a rule. The rules that read
-- these facts are in ito-s33a-credit-point.l4 and ito-s34-s36-s36a-credits.l4.
